# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo, regardless of each
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Git still checks files
# out with the OS-native line ending on disk; this only pins what
# gets stored/diffed in the repo itself.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary

# UTF-16 encoded (from `pip freeze` on Windows) — leave untouched,
# do not attempt text/line-ending normalization.
requirements.lock.txt -text
